  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Finely chop garlic.\n• Roughly chop zucchini and baby spinach leaves.\n• Grate carrot (see ingredients).\n• Drain and rinse chickpeas.\n• Pick and finely slice mint leaves.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bc1f04e871cb97455355b5-83e3016a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook chickpeas and zucchini, until zucchini is softened, 3-4 minutes.\n• Add chermoula spice blend and half the garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bc1f04e871cb97455355b5-dc28074a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Add diced tomatoes with onion & garlic, the water (for the sauce) and salt. Stir to combine. Simmer until sauce is slightly thickened, 2-4 minutes.\n• Add baby spinach, the butter and brown sugar and stir until spinach is wilted, 1 minute.\n• Season with salt and pepper.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bc1f04e871cb97455355b5-63f09db0.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• While the stew is simmering, heat a medium saucepan over medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook carrot and remaining garlic, stirring, until softened, 2-3 minutes.\n• Add the water (for the couscous) and remaining vegetable stock powder and bring to the boil.\n• Add couscous and currants, stirring to combine. Cover with a lid, then remove from heat. Leave until water is absorbed, 5 minutes. Fluff up with a fork.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bc1f04e871cb97455355b5-92990793.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a small bowl, combine Greek-style yoghurt, a drizzle of olive oil and half the mint. Season to taste.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bc1f04e871cb97455355b5-e3f06c14.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide carrot-currant couscous between bowls.\n• Spoon over Middle Eastern chickpea and tomato stew.\n• Top with a dollop of mint yoghurt.\n• Sprinkle with flaked almonds, fetta cubes and remaining mint to serve. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-66bc1f04e871cb97455355b5-eda37e61.jpeg"
    }
  ]
